 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nAtelier Provence SAS                              MASTER SERVICES\n                                                  AGREEMENT\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo, 13001 Marseille, France\nN° TVA: FR70 241206657\nReg No: FR-914679\n\nFROM                                              FACTURÉ À\nAtelier Provence SAS                              Groupe Horizon SA\n45 Avenue Victor Hugo                             12 Rue de la République\n13001 Marseille                                   75008 Paris\nFrance                                            France\nVAT: FR70 241206657\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 22/01/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered office at 45 Avenue Victor Hugo,\nMarseille (\"Party A\"), and Groupe Horizon SA, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République,\nParis (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 12 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of England and Wales.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Atelier Provence SAS / Pierre Martin\n Party B   Groupe Horizon SA / Sophie Bernard\n Date      22/01/2026",
